{"kp_id": "zj-007.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-007", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "中极在曲骨上1寸（脐下4寸），为膀胱募穴；取穴须准，肥胖者易误。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.cv3", "acupoint.cv2", "concept.mu_xue"], "chapter_id": "zj-007.c01", "evidence_quote": "上曲骨上一寸好曲骨上阴症，脐骨上阴策呢就是我们的中极穴", "seg_from": 81, "seg_to": 101, "start_s": 490.78, "end_s": 622.875, "citation": {"youtube_id": "JRRwpGikqw8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JRRwpGikqw8&t=490s", "series": "zj", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 07", "start_s": 490.78, "end_s": 622.88}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "阴症/阴策≈阴交附近口述", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-007.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-007", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "曲骨处体毛多，一般不灸。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.cv2"], "chapter_id": "zj-007.c01", "evidence_quote": "取骨穴呢这个穴道在因为这边体毛很多，所以一般我们不灸", "seg_from": 195, "seg_to": 195, "start_s": 1130.325, "end_s": 1137.665, "citation": {"youtube_id": "JRRwpGikqw8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JRRwpGikqw8&t=1130s", "series": "zj", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 07", "start_s": 1130.33, "end_s": 1137.66}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "取骨=曲骨", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-007.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-007", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "平补平泻：针下后左右捻转即可，手法后文详述。", "entity_ids": ["method.bu_xie"], "chapter_id": "zj-007.c02", "evidence_quote": "我们左转右转，左转右转好就可以了，这叫平补平心", "seg_from": 215, "seg_to": 219, "start_s": 1218.335, "end_s": 1246.12, "citation": {"youtube_id": "JRRwpGikqw8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JRRwpGikqw8&t=1218s", "series": "zj", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 07", "start_s": 1218.34, "end_s": 1246.12}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "平心=平泻", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-007.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-007", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "小便不出与夜尿过多皆可取膀胱相关募穴，体现虚实两端同一穴系、求平衡。", "entity_ids": ["zangfu.pang_guang", "concept.mu_xue"], "chapter_id": "zj-007.c02", "evidence_quote": "不管是膀胱小便湿禁啊，或者是小便不粗啊", "seg_from": 271, "seg_to": 272, "start_s": 1502.725, "end_s": 1530.27, "citation": {"youtube_id": "JRRwpGikqw8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JRRwpGikqw8&t=1502s", "series": "zj", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 07", "start_s": 1502.72, "end_s": 1530.27}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "湿禁=失禁；不粗=不出", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-007.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-007", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "关元为腹部要穴，治疼、小便不利、妇人症等；勿被病名吓住，按证取穴。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.cv4"], "chapter_id": "zj-007.c02", "evidence_quote": "这个关元穴，尤其进取穴，所有腹部我们刚刚讲了腹部的穴病像疼", "seg_from": 312, "seg_to": 312, "start_s": 1738.945, "end_s": 1750.795, "citation": {"youtube_id": "JRRwpGikqw8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JRRwpGikqw8&t=1738s", "series": "zj", "episode": 7, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 07", "start_s": 1738.94, "end_s": 1750.8}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "进取=近取", "source": "llm_read"}
